Package: nccs.data.efile
Title: NCCS IRS Form 990 E-File Producer
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("NCCS", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "thiyaghessan@gmail.com")
Description: Producer pipeline for extracting structured data from IRS
    Form 990 series e-file XML filings, publishing versioned parquet
    outputs to s3://nccsdata/processed/efile/. Implements the design
    pinned in decisions/0001-producer-design.md.
